      "text": "Let's, go and now dive a little deep into express-validator:\n------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's, go and now dive a little deep into express-validator:\n------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "k2HYlGM0JJ_Ifq9eK105K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 534.0287367783832,
      "y": 6616.81604079862,
      "width": 1604.1935740184456,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bcn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1542607442,
      "version": 164,
      "versionNonce": 486468562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730641507936,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "express-validator\nOverview\nexpress-validator is a set of express.js middlewares that wraps the extensive\ncollection of validators and sanitizers offered by validator.js.\n\nIt allows you to combine them in many ways so that you can validate and sanitize\nyour express requests, and offers tools to determine if the request is valid or\nnot, which data was matched according to your validators, and so on.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "express-validator\nOverview\nexpress-validator is a set of express.js middlewares that wraps the extensive collection of validators and sanitizers offered by validator.js.\n\nIt allows you to combine them in many ways so that you can validate and sanitize your express requests, and offers tools to determine if the request is valid or not, which data was matched according to your validators, and so on.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
