      "updated": 1730645566409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now let's make simple post and get api backend where post api will take userName and userAge \nand get will take name as query parameter to fetch the user record\n\nnow we want to make sure in the post route and get route that the value which user enter should not\nbe empty it should be string with max length of 32 character",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now let's make simple post and get api backend where post api will take userName and userAge \nand get will take name as query parameter to fetch the user record\n\nnow we want to make sure in the post route and get route that the value which user enter should not\nbe empty it should be string with max length of 32 character",
