      "text": "We need to add validation here for the query that \nthe client should only enter string of size 3 and it should not be empty\nquery(\"sort\").notEmpty().withMessage(\"sort query should not be empty\")\n.isLength({min:3,max:3}).isString().withMessage(\"query parameter should be String\");",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We need to add validation here for the query that \nthe client should only enter string of size 3 and it should not be empty\nquery(\"sort\").notEmpty().withMessage(\"sort query should not be empty\")\n.isLength({min:3,max:3}).isString().withMessage(\"query parameter should be String\");",
